# records assets/demo.gif from made-up data: vhs assets/demo.tape
Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1360
Set Height 440
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "prwatch -demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
